WEBVTT

00:08:28.612 --> 00:08:30.518
and we were attacked all over the place.

00:08:30.542 --> 00:08:31.722
But the bottom line

00:08:31.746 --> 00:08:34.993
was that Mississippi
gave birth to the Children's Defense Fund

00:08:35.017 --> 00:08:36.460
in many ways,

00:08:36.484 --> 00:08:40.239
and it also occurred to me that children

00:08:40.263 --> 00:08:42.377
and preventive investment,

00:08:42.401 --> 00:08:44.554
and avoiding costly care

00:08:44.578 --> 00:08:47.075
and failure and neglect,

00:08:47.099 --> 00:08:50.059
was a more strategic way to proceed.

00:08:50.083 --> 00:08:52.208
And so the Children's Defense Fund

00:08:52.232 --> 00:08:55.540
was born out of
the Poor People's Campaign.

00:08:55.564 --> 00:08:57.890
But it was pretty clear
that whatever you called

00:08:57.914 --> 00:08:59.780
black independent or brown independent

00:08:59.804 --> 00:09:01.833
was going to have
a shrinking constituency.